  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Alliance for the Horn of Africa Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EU Alliance for the Horn of Africa Initiative will contribute to regional economic and social integration in the Horn of Africa in particular for the benefit of women, youth, displaced people, migrants and other vulnerable populations. This will be achieved by enhancing trade and economic integration in the Horn of Africa to boost trade, sustainable growth, and decent jobs; and by strengthening resilience of vulnerable, displacement-affected communities to crisis, including climate-induced shocks and conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
